ch capture borders land the new holder already has."], ["King's Challenge", "HoG won the King's Challenge and takes the L6 and L5 that ĚØN held: Lionheart Fortress and Temple of War. HoG reaches them through Mithril Hall and lets go of Deepmere Town and Stardust Road to stay within six. WPP and NEXT keep their L6/L5 as the top two of the cycle; RAE keeps Temple of Nature."], ["ĚØN, third in the cycle", "ĚØN takes Deepmere Town (L3, Herb 10%) next to Falcon's Keep, so it keeps three real buffs: Dawnhold (L4), Falcon's Keep and Deepmere Town."], ["Everyone who fought gets a real buff", "UKR is fifth in the cycle but held no city above L2. It takes Gale Heights (L3, Timber 10%) from RISE, next to Crow's Beak and Goldgrain Town, and lets go of Old Oak to make room. RISE is tenth in the cycle and was on one of the three boards."], ["NOPE gets a herb buff", "NOPE takes Amber Road (L2, Herb 10%) from AURA; it borders three NOPE cities. There is no herb city smaller than 10% on the map. AURA keeps Drywell Tower (L3, Herb 10%) and refills its slot with Bluestone Slope, which nobody holds."], ["Free slots filled from next door", "Cities nobody holds go to an alliance next to them with room: Stardust Road to ZfP, Nymph Falls to NEXT."], ["What it leaves open", "ZfP is last in the cycle but keeps Emerald City (L4) and Cliffside Citadel (L3): only WPP and NEXT border Emerald City, and both are at or near six. FÂFÔ keeps Everpeak (L4); nobody on the boards borders it with a free slot except RAE. This plan holds for the next cycle, which starts after the bye week."]], "steps": [["Old Oak", "UKR", null], ["Amber Road", "AURA", null], ["Amber Road", null, "NOPE"], ["Bluestone Slope", null, "AURA"], ["Lionheart Fortress", "ĚØN", null], ["Deepmere Town", "HoG", null], ["Deepmere Town", null, "ĚØN"], ["Gale Heights", "RISE", null], ["Gale Heights", null, "UKR"], ["Nymph Falls", null, "NEXT"], ["Stardust Road", "HoG", null], ["Stardust Road", null, "ZfP"], ["Temple of War", "ĚØN", null], ["Temple of War", null, "HoG"], ["Lionheart Fortress", null, "HoG"]], "shareLabel": "Cycle score", "shareUnit": "pts", "cycle": ["2026-10-24", "2026-10-31", "2026-11-07"]}
